WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:07.801
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:10.934
What do they see?

3
00:00:10.935 --> 00:00:18.754
They see a campground.

4
00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:30.929
The blobs are ready to camp.

5
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:49.762
They take out their tent.

6
00:00:49.763 --> 00:01:29.920
They take out their food.

7
00:01:29.921 --> 00:01:46.056
They take out their lanterns.

8
00:01:46.057 --> 00:02:02.817
They take out their sleeping bags.

9
00:02:02.818 --> 00:02:10.779
They turn off their lanterns.

10
00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:14.468
Oh! It's not dark.

11
00:02:14.469 --> 00:02:22.526
Blobs, what are those lights?

12
00:02:22.527 --> 00:02:31.976
Wow! They are fireflies!

13
00:02:31.977 --> 00:02:34.809
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:37.953
Good-bye!

